<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-month bill yield rises to 20.96 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-month bill yield rises to 20.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 20.96 percent, up from 20.86 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     10,287.30 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.96 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     95.0339 pct</p>
</text>
